    "the_derivation_is_removed_not_improved": "The greatest common divisor of published prices is a MULTIPLE of the increment and equals it only when the sample happens to use every one. More history makes it a tighter upper bound on the tick, never a measurement of it. The endpoint publishes the quantity itself.",
